	(property "Description" "Waveshare Core2350B (RP2350B), 25.40 x 25.40mm, 64 plated holes of 1.0mm in a 10 x 10 grid at 2.54mm without its middle 6 x 6, for 2.54mm headers. Pads 1-64 = Waveshare's headers P1-P4, 16 pins each: P1 left edge, P2 top edge, P3 bottom edge, P4 right edge, with the flat cable socket at the top right; pad 1 = P1 pin 1 = GND, top left. GPIO0-47, VBUS, 3V3, 3V3_EN, ADC_VREF, RUN, BOOTSEL, SWCLK, SWDIO, USB_DP, USB_DM, 6 GND. GP40-GP47 are ADC0-ADC7; GP47 is the PSRAM's chip select. Flash and PSRAM on the underside. From the Waveshare dimension drawing and schematic."
		(at 0 0 0)
		(unlocked yes)
		(layer "F.Fab")
		(hide yes)
